      <JapaneseText>何も起こらんな～
もうお役ごめん、ってことだからべかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothin's happening, huh? Wonder if it's one
of those, "we no longer require your
services at our company," kind of things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>need context for this line, not sure what he's talking about</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
