    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>水を司る精霊ウンディーネ
北海の孤島にたたずむ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The spirit governing Water, Undine,
dwells on the solitary island in the
North Sea.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>風を司る精霊シルフ
嘆きの谷に舞う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The spirit that governs Wind, Sylph,
dances at the Valley of Lamentations.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>地を司る精霊ノーム
精霊の洞窟に居を構える</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The spirit governing Earth, Gnome,
resides in the Cave of Spirits.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
